  "bio": "Matryoshka Tattoo is renowned for their exceptional skill in crafting exquisite black&gray and floral tattoos that showcase a true depth of detail and artistry. Each piece created by Matryoshka Tattoo is a testament to their mastery over the medium, ensuring that clients leave with a timeless work of art. Their portfolio is a visual feast, and those interested can admire their prowess and range on their social media platforms such as @buck_tattoos, @saras_artistic_adventures, and @luisleyvatattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nSara's art @saras_artistic_adventures \nFelix's art @crappie.tatts\nNoah's art @mello.maus\nIf you want to check out my paintings @jbohlander\n\nSara's art @saras_artistic_adventures \nFelix's art @crappie.tatts\nNoah's art @mello.maus\nIf you want to check out my paintings @jbohlander",
